6.1 Hydraulic cylinder marking and labeling should be clearly visible and permanently marked on the cylinder body or nameplate, including:
— Name, model, type;
— Main technical parameters;
— Manufacturer name;
— Manufacturing date.

6.7 When installing cylinders, the nameplate should be positioned at the specified location with clear markings:
— Name, model;
— Batch number and serial number;
— Packaging dimensions (length, width, height);
— Selection of shipping address;
— Packing date;
— User name, location and station name;
— Shipping notes and work marks.
